<title>USA: Deluxe confirms plans to sell Colwell unit.</title>
<headline>Deluxe confirms plans to sell Colwell unit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deluxe Corp on Monday confirmed it plans to sell its Colwell health care forms business to Patterson Dental Co.</p>
<p>Details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>On August 23, Patterson Dental said it agreed to acquire the assets of Colwell.</p>
<p>Deluxe said Colwell, with manufacturing sites in Champaign, Ill., had 1995 sales of about $55 million.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
